  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airport Infrastructure Program. Phase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Aeroportuaria. Etapa I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to improve service quality and safety at the Trinidad and Cobija airports in the face of growing demand by providing international service and safety standards through infrastructure and equipment modernization, as well
as to support the Government of Bolivia in contributing to the institutional strengthening and sustainability of the airport sector ahead of implementation of the Airport Development Program.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
